<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - ASTRA CAPSA named Focus 1.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - ASTRA CAPSA named Focus 1.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Merrill Lynch said on Thursday it had named Argentina's Astra Cia Argentina de Petroleo SA an International Focus One stock.</p>
<p>-- Merrill Lynch also kept the company with a near-term accumulate, long-term buy recommendation.</p>
<p>-- The analyst was not immediately available for comment.</p>
<p>-- Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1730</p>
</text>
